Byron Knoll's Vector Playing Cards
===================================

These SVG playing cards were created by Byron Knoll and released into the
public domain. The Ace of Spades artwork is based on a design by Suzanne Tyson
that was vectorized using the potrace algorithm.

The original blog post describing the cards can be found at:
  https://byronknoll.blogspot.com/2011/03/vector-playing-cards.html

This bundle was mirrored from the GitHub repository maintained by notpeter:
  https://github.com/notpeter/Vector-Playing-Cards

The images may be used for any purpose without attribution, though attribution
is appreciated.
